
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The &#8220;largest and most systematic study of linguistic inequity in academic philosophy to date&#8221; was recently published.</p>



<span id="more-27311"></span>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Its authors are <a href="https://www.nerimarsili.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Neri Marsili</a> (University of Turin) and <a href="https://csl.mpg.de/en/paul-rehren" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Paul Rehren</a> (Max Planck Institute).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the following guest post, they share some of their findings.</p>



